={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $EG=GE={I}_{2}.$ Computing $EG$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}EG & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & -\\frac{2}{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{6}{5} \\\\ -\\frac{9}{5} & \\frac{6}{5}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{13}{5} & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false. As a result, $G\\ne {E}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557744 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "af6e0e43-fe72-533d-8ce8-b52921a85d3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557759} {:answer/id #uuid "bd898e4d-5a1c-5b90-9026-8badc38ea15a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557765}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557759} :answer-field/id #uuid "5b8c5578-01e3-5343-9d4f-ceab9a95811c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557726} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9fd317b7-c798-5691-b1ba-0c74608dec81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557751} {:answer/id #uuid "c4677bc8-584e-5a37-8e85-d19023d4fd41" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557771}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557771} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f089b2b-28ab-5800-9e30-9367b30f8877" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557739} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e13b5f01-cf51-5c98-9332-666698fbdfbd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answ